# TFM Music Compiler player (the player compiled into the tune "uzhos") on the card's YM2203 pair
describe Real-program trace (CL-2): "uzhos" (uzhos.scl), a TFM Music Compiler tune with its own player; the player
describe waits for the YM2203's busy flag (status bit 7 at #FFFD) before every register write
describe Pentagon 128 with zxbus.1 = multisound; RUN "uzhos"
machine pentagon128k
cpu 3.5
disk tsfm/uzhos.scl
trdos RUN "uzhos"
frames 260
shot tfmc-uzhos
save tfmc-uzhos
